睛里全是委屈和恼火，眼尾都气得泛起了一点薄红。","rawContent":"沈栖迟简直要被她气疯了。眼看着她的目光还黏在那个路人的背影上，他想都没想，直接伸出空着的那只手，捏住她的下巴，强行把她的脸转回来对准自己。灰蓝色的眼睛里全是委屈和恼火，眼尾都气得泛起了一点薄红。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:47","timestamp":1791100033301,"roundId":"round_1791100004025_5gl2djrb6","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790793702136_3gr3lhtj8","characterId":"045464e8-a183-492e-956f-8ed62d7792b2","_id":1375},{"id":1791539461146,"text":"高珞西你存心气我是吧！","rawContent":"高珞西你存心气我是吧！","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:47","timestamp":1791100036122,"roundId":"round_1791100004025_5gl2djrb6","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790793702136_3gr3lhtj8","characterId":"045464e8-a183-492e-956f-8ed62d7792b2","_id":1376},{"id":1791539461147,"text":"我说气话你听不出来吗！你还真去搭讪？！","rawContent":"我说气话你听不出来吗！你还真去搭讪？！","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:47","timestamp":1791100040880,"roundId":"round_1791100004025_5gl2djrb6","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790793702136_3gr3lhtj8","characterId":"045464e8-a183-492e-956f-8ed62d7792b2","_id":1377},{"id":1791539461148,"text":"他哪里帅了？眼睛没我大，个子也没我高，你到底什么眼光！","rawContent":"他哪里帅了？眼睛没我大，个子也没我高，你到底什么眼光！","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:47","timestamp":1791100050191,"roundId":"round_1791100004025_5gl2djrb6","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790793702136_3gr3lhtj8","characterId":"045464e8-a183-492e-956f-8ed62d7792b2","_id":1378},{"id":1791539461149,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"15:47","timestamp":1791100051982,"roundId":"round_1791100004025_5gl2djrb6","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"我不准你看他！你收回刚才那句话……明明我比他帅多了好不好！你再看别人，我就……我就当街咬你！","minimaxTimbreId":"moss_audio_fd8becd1-9d42-11f1-a083-168c55c08bf3","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"angry","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790793702136_3gr3lhtj8","character